// Multiplies two values by repeated addition.
// Inputs: 3, 4   Outputs: 12
       INP
       STA A
       INP
       STA B
LOOP   LDA B
       BRZ DONE
       SUB ONE
       STA B
       LDA RESULT
       ADD A
       STA RESULT
       BRA LOOP
DONE   LDA RESULT
       OUT
       HLT
A      DAT
B      DAT
RESULT DAT
ONE    DAT 1
